    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Story</h2>When the miners were digging underground, they accidentally opened some channels, inside which a continuous stream of monsters that would attack the precious energy crystals emerged. Fortunately, the miners have mastered a technique of using ore to synthesize defense towers. In order to resist the monster's attack, an adventure journey of mining and building defense towers begins!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><strong>1.The combination of mining and tower defense</strong><br>You need to plant defense towers by mining and gathering minerals to resist monsters' attacks. I believe this innovative game mode that combines mining and tower defense can give you a different experience.<br><u>Mining:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/f567907779a6a7fbeb59d671ae4947ec.poster.avif?t=1739915386\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/f567907779a6a7fbeb59d671ae4947ec.webm?t=1739915386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/f567907779a6a7fbeb59d671ae4947ec.mp4?t=1739915386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>Place defense towers to resist monsters:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/577e11d026ec31789c0899f92c14c4ed.poster.avif?t=1739915386\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/577e11d026ec31789c0899f92c14c4ed.webm?t=1739915386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/577e11d026ec31789c0899f92c14c4ed.mp4?t=1739915386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>2.Learn to utilize terrain</strong><br>There are intricate underground channels, and by modifying these channels to create favorable terrain, you can pass the levels more smoothly!<br><strong>3.Rich gameplay</strong><br>This game includes 42 regular levels, 9 unique entertainment levels, 3 boss levels, and 3 endless mode levels.<br>In addition, you will gain various tools and talismans on your adventure journey, which will make you even stronger!<br>In short, the rich gameplay makes mining never boring!<br><u>Unknown Minesweeper Mode:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/4fe00fc73cddd1029a18ca45fdb83feb.avif?t=1739915386\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><u>Powerful BOSS:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/fb957e1ba578e071f748515938cc5c9f.avif?t=1739915386\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>Hope you enjoy this indie game!",
