d026ec31789c0899f92c14c4ed.mp4?t=1739915386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>2.Learn to utilize terrain</strong><br>There are intricate underground channels, and by modifying these channels to create favorable terrain, you can pass the levels more smoothly!<br><strong>3.Rich gameplay</strong><br>This game includes 42 regular levels, 9 unique entertainment levels, 3 boss levels, and 3 endless mode levels.<br>In addition, you will gain various tools and talismans on your adventure journey, which will make you even stronger!<br>In short, the rich gameplay makes mining never boring!<br><u>Unknown Minesweeper Mode:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/4fe00fc73cddd1029a18ca45fdb83feb.avif?t=1739915386\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><u>Powerful BOSS:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964990/extras/fb957e1ba578e071f748515938cc5c9f.avif?t=1739915386\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>Hope you enjoy this indie game!",
